{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02844",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.29,
      "end_seconds": 4.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Hello, sorry about the delay, do sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 6.21,
      "end_seconds": 11.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.8,
      "end_seconds": 19.92,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. We'll go through it together. So what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 21.52,
      "end_seconds": 27.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "It's a severe headache, doctor. She didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.94,
      "end_seconds": 33.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.27,
      "end_seconds": 42.81,
      "duration_seconds": 7.54,
      "text": "It's been five days now. My neighbour said I should get it looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.54,
      "end_seconds": 49.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.89,
      "end_seconds": 51.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "I'd say mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.89,
      "end_seconds": 58.47,
      "duration_seconds": 6.58,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 58.57,
      "end_seconds": 63.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.92,
      "end_seconds": 72.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "I was getting to that! Oh, and seeing flashing lights."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 74.58,
      "end_seconds": 76.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Yes, exactly like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.72,
      "end_seconds": 83.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "Have you had any vaginal bleeding, reduced baby movements or leaking fluid?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.42,
      "end_seconds": 98.05,
      "duration_seconds": 13.63,
      "text": "No, no vaginal bleeding, no reduced baby movements, no leaking fluid. I did have swollen face and hands at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.96,
      "end_seconds": 102.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.67,
      "end_seconds": 105.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.96,
      "end_seconds": 108.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Alright, any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.54,
      "end_seconds": 113.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.03,
      "end_seconds": 116.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.15,
      "end_seconds": 121.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.68,
      "end_seconds": 125.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Right, who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.51,
      "end_seconds": 129.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.06,
      "end_seconds": 133.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "So, any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.85,
      "end_seconds": 141.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "I had a meniscus repair on my knee four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.47,
      "end_seconds": 153.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.19,
      "end_seconds": 157.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "No, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 159.02,
      "end_seconds": 166.47,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "Hold on, um, doctor, I think she reacted to diclofenac once. I'm not certain, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.88,
      "end_seconds": 170.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Really? I don't think so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.5,
      "end_seconds": 178.92,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "Okay, I'll note both of those. What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.51,
      "end_seconds": 181.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "My brother has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.14,
      "end_seconds": 185.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.97,
      "end_seconds": 203.84,
      "duration_seconds": 15.87,
      "text": "I have heart disease. Well, I've had high cholesterol for five years now. I've had arthritis in my knees for about a year now. I've had thin bones for five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.95,
      "end_seconds": 214.12,
      "duration_seconds": 9.17,
      "text": "Yes, heart disease and high cholesterol are known to us, good to have that clear. Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.68,
      "end_seconds": 219.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Aspirin, 75 milligrams, maybe, once a day for my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.61,
      "end_seconds": 224.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.54,
      "end_seconds": 237.86,
      "duration_seconds": 12.32,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. Rosuvastatin. I take it 10 milligrams, at night. Paracetamol, 650 milligrams, when needed for the knee pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 238.84,
      "end_seconds": 247.36,
      "duration_seconds": 8.52,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the paracetamol was 1300 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.89,
      "end_seconds": 255.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "Hm, that's different. Is the latest prescription anywhere near you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.42,
      "end_seconds": 265.15,
      "duration_seconds": 8.73,
      "text": "I don't think I have it with me. Alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week for my bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 266.83,
      "end_seconds": 274.07,
      "duration_seconds": 7.24,
      "text": "She is supposed to take it once a week, but I can't say she always does."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 285.18,
      "end_seconds": 294.63,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Saturation 98 percent, temp 36.8 degrees. Pulse is 86 beats a minute, BP is 152 over 104."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.66,
      "end_seconds": 297.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.44,
      "end_seconds": 302.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.42,
      "end_seconds": 306.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Yes, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.08,
      "end_seconds": 309.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "So, raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.61,
      "end_seconds": 324.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is very high and your reflexes are brisk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.46,
      "end_seconds": 337.21,
      "duration_seconds": 8.75,
      "text": "You can relax now. Having listened and examined, I can't pin this down yet. We're looking at severe pre-eclampsia or a migraine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.17,
      "end_seconds": 342.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Actually, I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.26,
      "end_seconds": 374.02,
      "duration_seconds": 29.76,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now severe pre-eclampsia is my leading thought, not anything worse. I'll request a urine protein test, it'll help with pre-eclampsia. I'll request urgent blood tests, it'll help with pre-eclampsia. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. What I'm giving you is labetalol, 200 milligrams, once now, single dose. You take it by mouth. That should help with severe hypertension."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 375.95,
      "end_seconds": 379.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Actually, alright, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 381.84,
      "end_seconds": 395.91,
      "duration_seconds": 14.07,
      "text": "You need to go to the maternity unit straight away. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Book a review straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 396.62,
      "end_seconds": 400.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "I'll book it on my way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 401.27,
      "end_seconds": 403.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 404.84,
      "end_seconds": 408.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 409.06,
      "end_seconds": 410.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}